[en.FOCUS_C02_ARMY_COUNCIL]
Ponyville Regional Security Council

[en.FOCUS_C02_ARMY_COUNCIL_desc]
Ponyville has only a small military (and perhaps just the right amount of riot police) to keep Empress Cozy Glow from worrying.\nBut it does worry Ponyville, and with the world situation getting more tense, Ponyville needs a security council to ensure its safety.\nWho’s on the council? You ask. Right now, just Trixie.\nWhat safety? You ask. I guess it must be economic safety, yeah.

[zh.FOCUS_C02_ARMY_COUNCIL]
小马谷地区安全委员会

[zh.FOCUS_C02_ARMY_COUNCIL_desc]
小马谷仅仅保持着少量的军队（和也许恰恰好量的防暴警察），这才不会让和煦光流女皇感到担忧。\n但这会让小马谷感到担忧，随着世界局势愈发紧张，小马谷有必要组建一个安全委员会，以确保小马谷的安全。\n哪些委员？你问。目前只有特丽克西一个。\n什么安全？你问。我猜一定是经济安全吧，应该吧。

